# Plot the schlenker functions we have developed. There are
# only 5 different ones, one of which is pre-existing,
# only 4 are new.
# The schlenker functions we need are non-decreasing, but
# 4 and 5 both have minima which makes them unsuitable.
s1(x)=x
s2(x)=3*x-6*x**2+4*x**3
s3(x)=15*x**2-50*x**3+60*x**4-24*x**5
s4(x)=9*x**2-20*x**3+12*x**4
s5(x)=6*x-21*x**2+28*x**3-12*x**4
#set terminal png
#set output "schlenker-functions.png"
set xrange [0:1]
plot s1(x), s2(x), s3(x)
#quit
